---
interface Props { detailed?: boolean }
const { detailed = false } = Astro.props;
---
<section class="operations-story site-container" id="platform"><div class="operations-intro"><p class="section-context">The work behind the numbers</p><h2>A Shift closes.<br />The record stays clear.</h2><p>Nozzle Readings, cash and the daily report each have their place. PumpOS keeps the connections visible.</p><a href={detailed ? '/docs/running-shifts' : '/product#shifts'} class="inline-link">{detailed ? 'Read the Shift guide' : 'Explore station operations'} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="shift-example product-replica" data-product-reveal><div class="replica-title"><span>Shift close</span><span>Sample data</span></div><div class="shift-example-body"><div class="shift-example-heading"><h3>Evening Shift</h3><span>Drawer reconciliation</span></div><dl><div><dt>Opening cash</dt><dd>₹5,000.00</dd></div><div><dt>Cash sales</dt><dd>₹48,200.00</dd></div><div><dt>Cash collections</dt><dd>₹3,000.00</dd></div><div><dt>Drawer expenses</dt><dd>−₹1,200.00</dd></div><div><dt>Cash drops</dt><dd>−₹20,000.00</dd></div><div class="expected-cash"><dt>Expected drawer cash</dt><dd>₹35,000.00</dd></div><div><dt>Counted cash</dt><dd>₹34,950.00</dd></div><div class="cash-variance"><dt>Shortage</dt><dd>₹50.00</dd></div></dl><p>A difference to investigate, not a number to hide.</p></div></div><div class="operations-sequence"><div><span>Nozzle Readings</span><p>Opening and closing readings determine Fuel Sales.</p></div><span class="sequence-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span><div><span>Shift Summary</span><p>The closed Shift records sales and drawer reconciliation.</p></div><span class="sequence-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span><div><span>Daily report</span><p>The DSSR brings the Business Day's records together.</p></div></div></section>
